<section class="cta"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 data-i18n="cta-title">Run 30 agents. <em>Herd them from your phone.</em></h2>
  <p style="color:var(--muted); margin:18px 0 30px;" data-i18n="cta-sub">Linux first · Windows/macOS in CI · Apache-2.0 core, AGPL-3.0 relay · signed alpha on the way</p>
  <div class="install">
    <span class="cmd"><span class="dollar">$ </span><span data-i18n="install-cmd2">git clone https://github.com/ivan-cavero/Arreo &amp;&amp; cargo build --workspace</span></span>
